:''For the enemy encountered in the [[Neon Genesis Evangelion Collaboration Event]], see [[EVA Unit-13 (Enemy)]].''
'''EVA Unit-13''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Neon Genesis Evangelion Collaboration Event|Neon Genesis Evangelion]] collaboration event. It was added in [[Version 12.4 Update|Version 12.4]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 710
|rarity = UR
|name1 = EVA Unit-13
|name2 = EVA Unit-13 & Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''EVA Unit-13 & Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
EVA Unit-13 is a serviceable counter to Aku threats with all the necessary abilities, being Strong Against them and its Surge Immunity dismisses one of their common gimmicks. Its stats and fast attack rate allow it to swiftly respond to these threats, and it outranges the vast majority of them while being able to tank some hits, proving to be a good match-up. Its general DPS is mediocre, but more than enough in early to mid-game, as well as certain late-game surge stages. However, its Mini-Surges tend not to do much and are best treated as a bonus. Its multi-hit is also worth mentioning, as while many Aku threats, especially Shielded ones, are difficult to ward off with brute force, when it does cause a target to be knocked back it may deny EVA Unit-13 from spawning a surge or hitting targets, reducing its overall DPS, and the unit itself has no option against enemy Shields, so support from others may still be necessary when it enters play.

{{Job|Classification = Backliner}}

